== Notes ==

* The post-1973 presidency remained dominated by the [[Balboan People's Party]], which held the office continuously until the 2025 election.
* The 1999 standoff between the Balboan military and the Hope and Survival Happiness Group occurred during the Rovira i Sastre administration and became a major catalyst for the creation of the [[National Police force of Balboa]].
* The 2024 Assembly election marked the first time the BPP lost its legislative majority, though the presidency remained in BPP hands until Lim Hui-jin's 2025 victory.

